[0.103, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2;35r\u001b[12S\u001b[r\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m b[40;1H\\u001b[38;3H\\u001b[?25h\\u001b[?2026l\"]\r\u001b[19B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m34\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24G\u001b[1mopenspec/changes/add-unequal-splits/proposal.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22m# Proposal\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  2 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  3 \u001b[22m## Why\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22mToday every expense is split equally between its participants, but real shared costs rarely are: one person orders the expensive dish, or a rent split\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m follows room sizes. Users need to record those expenses as they actually happened — by exact amounts or by percentages — without breaking any client \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22mthat already records equal splits or reads balances.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  8 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  9 \u001b[22m- `POST /groups/{groupId}/expenses` accepts an optional `splitType`: `\"equal\"` (default), `\"exact\"`, or `\"percent"]
[0.002, "o", "age\"`.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m  - `equal`: unchanged — uses `splitBetween`, same remainder rule. Requests without `splitType` behave exactly as before.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +34 lines \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mLollygagging…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m 2s · ↓\u001b[28G5.0k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[33B\u001b[38;2;233;154;122mLollygagging…\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
