[0.003, "o", "1.00\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m\"` \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mexpense at `\"25\"\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m     -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m` \u001b[48;2;61;1;0mpercent\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m each between four members\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m                                                                                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 162 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **THEN** the four-member expense gives each member `\"0.25\"`, identical to an equal split of the same amount                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 161 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **WHEN** a `\"\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m0\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m02\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m\"` expense is split between Alice, Bob and Carol \u001b[48;2;4;71;0m(added in that order) \u001b[48;2;2;40;0mat `\"\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m25\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m\"`, `\"\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m25\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m\"` and `\"\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m50\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m\"` percent                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 162 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **THEN** Alice's share is `\"0.01\"`, Bob's is `\"0.00\"` and Carol's is `\""]
[0.001, "o", "0.01\"` (Alice and Bob tie on remainder, so the earlier member wins)        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 163 \u001b[22m \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 164 \u001b[22m ### Requirement: Unequal split details in expense responses\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 165 \u001b[22m For `\"exact\"` and `\"percentage\"` expenses, the system SHALL return `splits` with the submitted per-member values normalized to exactly two fraction \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m digits (e.g. `\"60\"` → `\"60.00\"`), and SHALL return `splitBetween` as the participant ids in the order they were listed in `splits`. Equal-split expe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m nses SHALL NOT include `splits`.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=bdtbku;file:///Users/maryam/Workspace/sdd-bake-off/frameworks/openspec/openspec/changes/add-unequal-splits/specs/expense-recording/spec.md\u0007openspec/changes/add-unequal-splits/specs/expense-recording/spec.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;230;149;117mLollygagging…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m 49s · ↓\u001b[29G10.8k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to "]
