[0.001, "o", "rs with no activity SHALL appear with `\"0.00\"`. Each entry SHALL contain exactly `memberId`, `name` and `balance`. It SHALL respo\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22mnd `404` for an unknown group.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  7 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  9 \u001b[22m- **WHEN** Alice pays `\"30.00\"` split equally between Alice, Bob and Carol\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m- **THEN** the balances are Alice `\"20.00\"`, Bob `\"-10.00\"`, Carol `\"-10.00\"`\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +25 lines \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;220;129;97mLollygagging…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m 58s · ↓\u001b[29G11.8k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
