[0.001, "o", "`. As long as every expense's shares sum to its amount, balances stay exac\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22mt and sum to zero, whatever produced the shares.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22mional: true` is also in effect. It only strips properties where a schema sets `additionalProperties: false`, and no schema here does.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +100 lines \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mLollygagging…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(2m 54s · ↓\u001b[29G17.5k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
